{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_49509","headline":"虞美人 · 鹿虔扆","name":"虞美人","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"卷荷香澹浮烟渚，绿嫩擎新雨。\n琐窗疎透晓风清，象牀珍簟冷光轻，水文平。\n九疑黛色屏斜掩，枕上眉心歛。\n不堪相望病将成，钿昏檀粉泪纵横，不胜情。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"鹿虔扆","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_49509.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_49509","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}